flowchart TD
    A[Start: Inbound Call / Chat] --> B[Greeting & Collect Email or Phone]
    B --> C[Identity Lookup: Match on Email/Phone]
    C --> C1{Match Found?}

    C1 -->|Yes| D[Confirm Name + DOB<br/>secondary check, not primary lookup]
    D --> D1{Confirmed?}
    D1 -->|No Match| F
    D1 -->|Confirmed| Q[Scheduling Preferences]

    C1 -->|No| F{Emergency Indicators?}
    F -->|Yes: severe pain, swelling, trauma, bleeding| G[Immediate Triage Script]
    G --> H[Escalate: Transfer to Live Staff / Emergency Line]

    F -->|No - routine| I[PHIPA Consent Capture]
    I -->|Declined| J[Explain Limits Without Consent + Offer Callback]
    I -->|Given| K[Demographics Capture]

    K --> L[Insurance & Billing Info]
    L --> M[Medical History: Allergies, Meds, Conditions]
    M --> N[Dental History: Reason for Visit, Last Dentist]
    N --> O{Patient Under 18?}

    O -->|Yes| P[Guardian Identity + Consent Capture]
    O -->|No| Q

    P --> Q
    Q --> R[Confirm Appointment & Read-Back Summary]
    R --> S[Send Confirmation Email]
    S --> T[End / Close Loop]
